{
  "Version": 1.0,
  "Metadata": {
    "Project": "Lemon",
    "Description": "A two-finger spread on the home screen. A soft catch, a low swell that thins out as it travels, three rings that lose weight and gain sharpness towards the edges, and a last crisp tick when the ripple settles and the badges are gone. The timeline follows the ripple: 0.5 s of motion, up to 0.1 s of per-icon delay, and a 0.62 s tail for the settle."
  },
